---
import { Eye, Shield, Cpu, GitBranch, Layers, Activity, Wrench } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section id="narrative" class="space-y-8 scroll-mt-24">
  {/* Section Header */}
  <div class="flex items-end justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-4 flex-wrap gap-2">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        Brand Narrative &amp; Semantic Anatomy
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">
        The philosophical and architectural meaning engineered into every contour of Ollie
      </p>
    </div>
    <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-800 text-amber-400 border border-slate-700">
      Brand Foundation
    </span>
  </div>

  {/* 3 Semantic Anatomy Cards */}
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    {/* Card 1 */}
    <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl border border-sky-500/20 hover:border-sky-500/50 transition-all space-y-3">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-sky-400">
        <Eye className="w-5 h-5" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-sky-400">1. The Azure Crest &amp; Broad Wing</h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Represents <strong class="text-white">Broad Vision</strong>. High altitude panoramic oversight of distributed cloud architecture, cross-cluster Kubernetes deployments, and enterprise-wide CI/CD pipelines.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Card 2 */}
    <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl border border-amber-500/20 hover:border-amber-500/50 transition-all space-y-3">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400">
        <Shield className="w-5 h-5" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-amber-400">2. The Solar Beacon Shield</h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Represents <strong class="text-white">Sage Guidance</strong>. A radiant amber beacon illuminating the developer’s workflow, guiding autonomous AI agents with precision, safety, and deep mentorship.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Card 3 */}
    <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/40 hover:border-slate-500/60 transition-all space-y-3">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white">
        <Cpu className="w-5 h-5" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">3. The Dual Optical Sensors</h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        The technical eyeglass frames symbolize <strong class="text-white">Deep Algorithmic Telemetry</strong>, AI analytics, and observability. The white bridge connects infrastructure to intelligence seamlessly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* DPE Initiative & Open-Source Mission Card */}
  <div class="glass-panel p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-amber-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900/80 via-[#0A1128]/90 to-[#050814]/95 space-y-6">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2">
      <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-amber-400">
        Developer Platform Engineering (DPE) Initiative &amp; Mission
      </h3>
      <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-sky-950/60 text-sky-400 border border-sky-800">
        The Open-Source Way
      </span>
    </div>

    {/* Mission & Vision Side-by-Side */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/60 border-l-4 border-amber-400 space-y-1">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">
          Mission
        </span>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Broadsage champions the open-source way by building transparent, community-driven technologies and transforming distributed open-source stacks—from agentic AI to cloud infrastructure—into hardened, enterprise-grade architectures that empower engineering freedom without vendor lock-in.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/60 border-l-4 border-sky-400 space-y-1">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-sky-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">
          Vision
        </span>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          <em>“Broad Vision, Sage Guidance — Open to Everyone.”</em> To be the global catalyst and trusted foundation for open enterprise computing. By uniting radical open-source transparency with calm, authoritative architectural guidance, Broadsage ensures that the future of software engineering remains open, sovereign, and accessible to all developers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
      Broadsage operates as a specialized Developer Platform Engineering (DPE) initiative. Rather than fragmenting into fictional commercial product silos, our identity serves as the strategic architectural conduit uniting fast-moving open-source innovation with hardened enterprise platform engineering.
    </p>

    {/* 4 DPE Pillars Grid */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 pt-2">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800/80 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-400">
          <Shield className="w-4 h-4" />
          <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Open-Source Hardening</h4>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-normal">
          Curating, auditing, and securing distributed open-source stacks for enterprise stability.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800/80 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sky-400">
          <Cpu className="w-4 h-4" />
          <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Autonomous Agentic Mesh</h4>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-normal">
          Integrating AI review agents, LLM reasoning meshes, and automated developer loops into CI/CD.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800/80 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400">
          <Activity className="w-4 h-4" />
          <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Unified Telemetry</h4>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-normal">
          High-throughput OpenTelemetry and ClickHouse streaming metrics tracking DORA and health.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800/80 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-purple-400">
          <Wrench className="w-4 h-4" />
          <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Paved Roads &amp; CLI</h4>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-normal">
          Open-source developer CLI runtimes, standardized golden paths, and self-service environments.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

